{"id":"661122","name":"牛肉卷","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661122/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肥牛卷","amount":"适量"},{"name":"彩椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"手抓饼","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"马苏里拉芝士碎","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"彩椒洗净切小块。","img":"images/661122/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/661122/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入洋葱炒出香味。","img":"images/661122/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入山姆的肥牛卷。","img":"images/661122/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量蚝油，生抽，老抽，盐。","img":"images/661122/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量烧烤料和孜然。","img":"images/661122/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀入味。","img":"images/661122/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入彩椒。","img":"images/661122/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"快速拌匀后晾凉。","img":"images/661122/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入芝士碎拌匀。","img":"images/661122/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"手抓饼提前解冻。","img":"images/661122/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将炒过的肥牛码在手抓饼上。","img":"images/661122/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放上芝士碎。","img":"images/661122/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"将饼皮捏紧收口。","img":"images/661122/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"饼皮洒上少许白芝麻。","img":"images/661122/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"刷上薄薄一层蛋黄液。","img":"images/661122/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"烤箱提前预热230度烤20分钟。","img":"images/661122/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661122/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661122/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}